At two variables of 3 and 2 functions the names are \code{bs1.P0}, \code{bs1.P1},
\code{bs2.P0}, \code{bs2.P1}, \code{bs3.P0}, \code{bs3.P1}.

That order matters when coefficients are supplied as an array, R storing an
